  "measurementTechnique": "Logical consistency: Interlaboratory comparisons, calibration of instrumentation with known standards.\n\nCompleteness: Dataset Complications: Before 1988, analyses were done on an infrared spectrometer; after 1988 they were done on a mass spectrometer.\n\nProcessing step (1980): DFO and AES collaborative data.",
